tend to look at every message.

2) For everyone else, complex (or at least not simple), ranking systems
will enhance the value of those who rank the most; the more you rank
the more the system will know about what you like.

3) Also, the more you read the list at odd times, or because of work, etc,
have to skip a day, the more ranking will help you. The reason is that you
can benefit from those who rank prior to you; while you help those who rank
after you, etc.

